## Deviations from the ruling

None in semantics. Three implementation notes: (1) the consult appears at three compiler/library sites (call-site routing, `dsg__admitted?`, `_descriptor` + `js/cell?`/`py/cell?`) because routing-decides-path and admission-decides-callable are distinct questions — this is the sweep the checklist itself requires; (2) the library-lane test fixture now registers the cell module (alignment, justified above); (3) **cljstyle could not be run** — no binary is reachable in this worktree; kondo (the brief's requirement) is clean and edits match surrounding style. Also note for the gate: `clojure -M:test -e …` runs the full suite first (known trap), and cognitect's `-v` needs fully-qualified var symbols.
